"“Distribute horizontally with even horizontal gaps” button (read the button "
"tooltips). The objects are now neatly aligned and distributed with equal "
"spaces in between. Here are some other alignment and distribution examples:"
msgstr ""
"Chansen är stor att dina kopior av fyrkanten är placerade mer eller mindre "
